WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Just brother

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,120
Everyone is from the same neighborhood

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,680
There are many abandoned buildings around

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,320
There's no need to grab this one, right?

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,920
Go forward and attack later, it’s fermenting

6
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,800
Just now he said he would be rude to us

7
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,400
Now I see there are so many of us

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,600
Start to make sense

9
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,800
sorry sorry

10
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,600
Just now, I was speaking unabashedly

11
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,240
We really don't want to think about conflict.

12
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:27,300
No need to apologize

13
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,780
Tell me why you have to block the door

14
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,620
Me and the rest of our team

15
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,780
Searching for supplies in the building

16
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,180
Worried about monsters getting in

17
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,820
So we hang out outside

18
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,020
I think there is something good in the building

19
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,900
You guys are just blocking the door and trying to swallow it up, right?

20
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,120
What good stuff can be found in an abandoned building?

21
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,640
But do you know

22
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,640
Where are the resources nearby?

23
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,760
I heard it said in the chat room

24
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,840
This is just the outskirts of the city

25
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,920
If you go to the city center

26
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,920
There are large supermarkets and commercial streets with a lot of resources.

27
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,200
Let's go to the office building next door.
